{"agent":"fleet-healthwatch","data":{"body":"DX-health-watch ships STALLED, LOCKED, CRASHED (expired lease over work) and RUNAWAY (job age). Not yet covered from its spec: lease heartbeats do not carry pid, host or session id, so a dead holder is seen only after the TTL, not in minutes; the same gate failing N times or a review-round loop as RUNAWAY (loops.max_repeated_failures exists, unread by the watchdog); UNRESPONSIVE (a nudge or yield request unanswered for a limit); STARVED (governor context/quota pressure); a nudge/park correction step and a dispatcher-plan consumer of the findings.","globs":["ddflow/core/health.py","ddflow/services/healthwatch.py","tests/test_health_watch_liveness.py"],"line":"","needs":["DX-health-watch"],"parent":"","priority":100,"tags":[],"title":"Health watch: dead-process crash detection, repeated-gate runaway, unresponsive and starved lanes"},"id":"e6c233999911b42962667f37a","kind":"task.added","lamport":66889,"schema":1,"subject":"DX-health-watch-liveness","ts":"2026-10-16T07:55:55.946446Z"}
{"agent":"fleet-healthwatch","data":{"budget":"","claim":"Yes: progress watermark (leasebreak), wait cycles (leasewait), expired-lease scan (leases.scan) and job status already hold every fact; corrections reuse lease.expired, task.updated(auto_order) and cadence.ran.","dedupe":{"answer":"new","candidates":[],"score":null},"falsifier":"A stalled-but-heartbeating lane with a waiter is not reported, or apply deletes a worktree/branch.","item":"DX-health-watch","mechanism":"core.health.inspect takes Lane/Proc/Wait values; services.healthwatch gathers them and applies moves per [health].mode.","probe":"uv run pytest tests/test_health_watch.py (20 tests incl. apply keeps worktree file and branch)","probe_output":"20 passed","question":"Can a pure function over lease/job/wait facts distinguish stalled, locked, crashed and runaway lanes without a new event kind or daemon?","sources":[],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"e421a6c0ac3dcba09056f5602","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":66891,"schema":1,"subject":"R259b53665f","ts":"2026-10-16T07:56:25.737499Z"}
